# Copy to .env.local and fill in your own key. Never commit a real key.
# Get a FREE key at https://openrouter.ai/keys (no credit card required).
# The free tier is enough: this app only calls :free vision models.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# Optional: override the model chain (comma-separated, first = preferred).
# Defaults to the failover chain in src/lib/openrouter.ts
# OPENROUTER_MODELS=
